# CLAUDE.md was served publicly at /CLAUDE.md (HTTP 200, 33 KB). It exposed an unannounced
# commercial decision with its reasoning, and pointed at where the admin credentials live.
# Nothing linked from the site lives in here — only whitepaper.pdf at root is referenced,
# and *.md does not match it.
CLAUDE.md
*.md
docs/
scripts/
contracts/
build/
.claude/

# Card-separation BUILD OUTPUT — 23 MB of the 31 MB in models/cards/ that nothing fetches.
# The only thing the site reads is models/cards/<n>/layers/*.png, named by the sidecars in
# cards/art/hero/*.layers.json — resolved all 34 srcs, every one lives under layers/.
# Everything below is what png23d/Blender emitted on the way there: the packed mesh, the
# contact sheets, and card 44's source maps. Kept in git (they are how a card is re-cut);
# kept off the CDN (a collector opening one card would otherwise pay for six cards of
# exploded-view PNGs they never see).
models/cards/*/preview/
models/cards/*/layers.glb
models/cards/*/channels.glb
models/cards/*/channels/
models/cards/44/albedo.png
models/cards/44/normal.png
models/cards/44/height.png
models/cards/44/ao.png
models/cards/alley-trio/*.glb
